text.en:
Section 3 of the Income Tax Act, in this Order referred to as the Act, is

(a) in subsection (I), by deleting "public notification" from the second line and by substituting "notification published in the Gazette" therefor ;

(b) in subsection (2), by deleting "public notification" from the first line and by substituting "notification published in the Gazette" therefor ;

(c) by inserting the following new subsection immediately after subsection (41 - "(4A) The Collector may specify the form of any return, claim, statement or notice to be made or given under this Act.".
